docs {
  # Toggle Group Simplify Debts (`ToggleGroupSimplify`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.ToggleGroupSimplify` in [group_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/group_handler.go)
  **Route**: `PUT /api/_private/v1/groups/:groupId/toggle-simplify` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Toggles the `simplifyDebts` boolean flag on the group between `true` and `false`.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `groupId` (string, path parameter): Group ID.
}
